#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:17
msgid "Create permissions"
msgstr "Opret tilladelser"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:19
msgid "There are four permission types:"
msgstr "Der findes fire tilladelsestyper:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:21
msgid "``a_*`` Administrator"
msgstr "``a_*`` Administrator"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:22
msgid "``m_*`` Moderator"
msgstr "``m_*`` Moderator"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:23
msgid "``u_*`` User"
msgstr "``u_*`` Bruger"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:24
msgid "``f_*`` Forum"
msgstr "``f_*`` Forum"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:26
msgid ""
"You can create new permissions for each of these types and assign them to "
"user groups or permission roles. You can also define new roles to assign "
"your permissions to if desired."
msgstr ""
"Du kan oprette nye tilladelser for hver af disse typer og tildele dem til "
"brugergrupper eller tilladelsesroller. Du kan også definere nye roller at "
"tildele dine tilladelser til, hvis det ønskes."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:30
msgid ""
"Permissions must first be created in a migration using the "
":doc:`../migrations/tools/permission`. It helps with adding, removing, "
"setting, and unsetting permissions and adding or removing permission roles. "
"For example, to create a new User permission ``u_foo_bar`` and set it to "
"``YES`` for the Registered Users group and the Standard User Role:"
msgstr ""
"Tilladelser skal først oprettes i en migrering ved hjælp af "
":doc:`../migrations/tools/permission`. Dette hjælper med at tilføje, fjerne,"
" aktivere og deaktivere tilladelser samt tilføje eller fjerne "
"tilladelsesroller. For f.eks. at oprette en ny brugertilladelse "
"``u_foo_bar`` og sætte den til ``YES`` for gruppen Registrerede brugere og "
"Standard User-rollen:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:45
msgid "Define permissions"
msgstr "Definér tilladelser"

